        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_INCOME" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Income per turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_UPKEEP" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Upkeep per turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_OUTSTANDING" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Owed on loans</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_DUE_NEXT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Loan payments due next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_SERVICE_SHARE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Share of income going to loans</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_INSOLVENT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Your income has been at or below 0 for five turns or more. Emergency loans only cover a short spell; cut upkeep or raise Gold.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_PROJECTION" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Next 20 turns</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_PROJECTION_WITH" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Balance in 20 turns with your loans</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_PROJECTION_WITHOUT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Balance in 20 turns without them</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_PROJECTION_NOTE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Income held flat; light bars are with your loans, dark bars without. Hover a bar for the figure.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_FLOWS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>What moved, and why</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_NO_FLOWS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Loans haven't moved any of your Gold yet.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_FLOWS_NOTE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>The newest lines first; the last batch ran on turn {1_Turn}.</Text></Replace>
