        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_DEPTH_TURNS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Extra turns of income on your credit limit</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_TREASURY_DEPTH_FACTOR" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Rate factor from depth</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_LIMITS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Your limits</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_CREDIT_ROOM" Language="fr_FR"><Text>You can still borrow up to</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_SERVICE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Payments per turn, of the limit</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_SERVICE_OF" Language="fr_FR"><Text>{1_Used} of {2_Cap} Gold</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_STANDING" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Standing (1.00 is clean)</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_STAGES" Language="fr_FR"><Text>What's open to you</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_STAGES_ALL_OPEN" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Every lender of this age is open to you.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_STAGE_CLOSED" Language="fr_FR"><Text>{1_Part} opens with {2_Node}.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_STAGE_NEXT_AGE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>the next age</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_PART_CIV_LOANS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Loans from other civilizations</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_PART_BOND" Language="fr_FR"><Text>The bond market and longer terms</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_BORROW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Borrow</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_BORROW_NO_OFFERS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Nobody will lend you this amount on these terms right now.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_BORROW_OVER_ROOM" Language="fr_FR"><Text>That's more than your credit limit allows.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_OFFER_SERVICE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>With this loan, your payments would take {1_Percent}% of your income.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_OFFER_ROW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>{1_Lender}: {2_Rate} a turn, about {3_Payment} Gold a turn, {4_Interest} Gold of interest in all</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_MINE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Your loans</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_NONE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>You don't owe anyone anything.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_ROW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>{1_Loan}: {2_Owed} Gold owed to {3_Lender} at {4_Rate} a turn, {5_Turns} payments left</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_PAYMENT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Next payment</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_ACTIVE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>On schedule</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_OVERDUE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Overdue, {1_Count} missed</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_DEFAULT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>In default</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOAN_EMERGENCY" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Emergency loan</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_REPAY_ALL" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Repay all next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_REPAY_HALF" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Repay half next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_RESTRUCTURE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Restructure</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_REPUDIATE_LENDER" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Repudiate what you owe {1_Lender}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RESTRUCTURE_PREVIEW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>What's left, {1_Owed} Gold, spreads over 10 new turns at the current {2_Rate}: about {3_Payment} Gold a turn. Your standing takes one more miss, and this loan can't be restructured again.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REPUDIATE_PREVIEW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>You keep {1_Kept} Gold and stop paying. {2_Lender} books a grudge of {3_Grudge} grievances against you; {4_Count} civilizations you've met each move {5_Delta} in relationship; your standing falls to {6_Standing}; {7_Lender} closes to you for {8_For}; your credit limit loses {9_Turns} turns of income and terms stay at 10 turns for 40 turns.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_REPUDIATE_AT_WAR" Language="fr_FR"><Text>You're at war with this lender, so the world expects it: the witness and standing costs are halved.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_CLOSED_TURNS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>{1_Turns} turns</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_CLOSED_AGES" Language="fr_FR"><Text>the rest of this age and the whole of the next</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_LENT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>What you've lent</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LENT_ROW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>{1_Loan}: {2_Owed} Gold owed to you by {3_Borrower} at {4_Rate} a turn, {5_Turns} payments left</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_ALLOW_RESTRUCTURE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Let them restructure</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Lend</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_NOBODY" Language="fr_FR"><Text>There's no civilization to lend to.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_BOND_RATE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Their bond rate is {1_Rate}; they accept up to 1.2 times it</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_RISK" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Repudiation risk: {1_Text}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LEND_RULE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>They accept while they're short of Gold, their income is positive and the payments fit their limits. If they default or repudiate, the loss is yours.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_LOW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>low. They repudiate a debt to an enemy at war, or to a civilization they dislike while insolvent or in default.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_WAR" Language="fr_FR"><Text>high: you're at war with them, and they repudiate debts to enemies.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_INSOLVENT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>they've had no income for {1_Turns} turns; they can't take your loan and may repudiate what they owe.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_NO_INCOME" Language="fr_FR"><Text>their income is at or below 0, so they won't accept.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_DEFAULT" Language="fr_FR"><Text>they're in default on another loan.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_RISK_UNFRIENDLY" Language="fr_FR"><Text>they dislike you: a debt over {1_Amount} Gold is one they'd repudiate while in trouble.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Auto-loan guard</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_STATE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>The guard is</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_ALLOWANCE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Emergency allowance left</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_SWITCH_ON" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Switch the guard on</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_SWITCH_OFF" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Switch the guard off</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_GUARD_NOTE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>The guard borrows for you when your balance would go below 0 while your income is at or below 0, which is when the game disbands units. A dip with positive income costs nothing, so it leaves that alone.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_PENDING" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Queued for next turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_PENDING_NONE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Nothing queued.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_LOANS_PENDING_NOTE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Requests run at the start of the next turn, in this order. The turn's notice says what was refused and why.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CARDS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Tax cards</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_TAXES_OFF" Language="fr_FR"><Text>The Taxes option is off for this game, so there are no tax cards.</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_ACTIVE" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Slotted</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_LOCKED" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Not unlocked yet</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_LOCKED_BY" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Opens with {1_Node}</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_NOW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Your settlements now</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_GOLD_NOW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Gold a turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_HAPPINESS_NOW" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Happiness a turn</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CELEBRATION" Language="fr_FR"><Text>Next celebration</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CELEBRATION_TURNS" Language="fr_FR"><Text>in {1_Turns} turns</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CELEBRATION_NEVER" Language="fr_FR"><Text>not until your Happiness rises</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_CELEBRATING" Language="fr_FR"><Text>you're celebrating now</Text></Replace>
        <Replace Tag="LOC_ECONOMICS_FISCAL_NO_CARD" Language="fr_FR"><Text>No tax card</Text></Replace>
